# Build context for .harness/Dockerfile (docker-compose.yml:
# context: .. , dockerfile: .harness/Dockerfile).
#
# The image only COPYs the two provisioner scripts from .harness/sh/, so
# everything else is kept out of the context: notably record-only/node_modules
# (~730 MB), record-only/target, .git, and .harness/.env, which may hold API
# keys. If the Dockerfile starts COPYing more files, allow them here too.
*
!.harness
.harness/*
!.harness/sh
.harness/sh/*
!.harness/sh/*.sh
